---
description: ARM assembly sources (non-macro) in asm/
globs: asm/**/*.s
alwaysApply: false
---

# Assembly (`.s`)

- **Conventions**: Match register usage, section directives, and symbol naming used in the same file or sibling routines.
- **Interfacing with C**: Respect calling convention and structure layouts defined in headers; verify offsets if touching `struct` members used from asm.
- **Scope**: Prefer small, localized changes; large routine additions should mirror an existing equivalent in the codebase.

Macros used by event scripts live primarily in `asm/macros/event.inc` — see the script-commands rule when changing script bytecode layout.
